WEBVTT

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:16.040
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.330
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:22.830
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:26.490
and spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:30.620
The Holy Sword Aea shows
its power during battle.

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:36.700
Kasel is confused and afraid of
the fact that he could not control it,

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:40.120
but nevertheless, he continues
his journey to unseal the Holy Sword,

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:43.290
by travelling to meet Pavel,
in the Windland Snow Mountains.

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:49.990
I've been pursuing pure power,
so that I can get stronger, but...

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:52.950
I don't think that's good enough.

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:58.790
If I let my own heart defeat me,
I can't correctly use the Holy Sword's power.

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.240
<i>When the red-stained night comes</i>

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:09.450
<i>I paint you on the sky</i>

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:24.330
<i>The hidden truth</i>

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:28.870
<i>The sudden suffocation</i>

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:34.120
<i>You are so distant, fading</i>

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:38.790
<i>Do you feel it too?</i>

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:41.120
<i>Crossing blades</i>

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:43.950
<i>Cannot touch</i>

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:48.580
<i>The sadness that lies beyond</i>

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.080
<i>I just want to see you</i>

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:55.040
<i>I search for you</i>

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:58.490
<i>Now, Eclipse</i>

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:03.370
<i>I always want to be by your side</i>

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:06.040
<i>I send a wish to the sky</i>

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:08.240
<i>I believe in destiny</i>

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:10.660
<i>When the sun and moon meet</i>

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:13.120
<i>At that moment</i>

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:16.330
<i>I run to you</i>

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:20.200
<i>With all my heart</i>

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:33.910
<i></i>The Mercenary with

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:33.910
<i></i>Wings of Freedom

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:48.080
Found you! There you are, of all places!

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:49.450
Um...?

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:53.620
I'm so glad you're safe! Where have
you been for three whole weeks,

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:54.870
Miss Elaine?

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:56.330
Miss Elaine...?

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:59.410
Um, I think you have the wrong person.

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:02.490
My name is Frey. I'm a traveler, and--

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:06.990
Oh, did you hit your head in an accident
and lose your memory or something?

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:11.660
Oh, I know--you must have been tricked
by a bad man and ran away from home!

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:12.990
Happens all the time.

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:15.540
No, I, um--

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:16.910
Who are you?

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:23.040
Is this the guy?!
He must have tricked you and...

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:24.410
And, well...

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:26.700
Oh, dang, he's hot!

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:28.790
Wow, I really understand how you feel.

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:31.660
He makes me feel like
it'd be okay to let him trick me!

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:33.330
Uh...

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:36.290
Frey, let's go.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:43.660
Ah, so I was mistaken.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.370
I'm sorry, Miss Frey!

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:49.040
I do tend to get carried away by my imagination.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:52.580
And I'm sorry I assumed you were a bad man.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:54.870
By the way, what's your name?

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:57.660
I don't need to tell you that.

00:03:57.660 --> 00:03:59.660
His name is Roi.

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:02.080
Roi! What a nice name.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:07.660
I'm Reina. I was hired by the people
in the village up ahead to find someone.

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:09.080
What about you?

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:12.040
We are going to visit that village.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:14.490
I see! In that case, let's--

00:04:18.450 --> 00:04:21.240
Yay! We got dinner for Kasel!

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.290
Don't touch it!

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:26.330
The spiders around here
are venomous. You can't eat them.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.830
Oh no.

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.660
Too bad, Kasel.

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.160
Um, yeah...

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.240
Since when were you there?

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:35.290
I've been standing here for a while now...

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:38.790
Really? Sorry!

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:42.870
She's right though. Kasel can be
a bit lacking in presence.

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:44.450
Huh? Really?

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:45.910
There, there.

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:47.660
Who are you?

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:53.120
You aren't just an ordinary tourist, either.
I sense something shady.

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:57.950
Whatever. I have no intention
of getting deeply involved with you.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:01.200
Let me introduce myself.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:05.490
I'm a mercenary. I work for money.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:07.160
Mercenary...

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:10.370
Pay is the only thing that concerns me.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:15.580
Of course, if you want to hire me,
that would be fine, too.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:18.910
That said, you all look so broke!

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:23.240
Sorry, I don't do pro bono work.

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:29.080
I've heard rumors about a highly skilled
mercenary named Reina.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:30.370
Is that you?

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:35.120
Yes, I am the famously beautiful mercenary!

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:39.200
That was a waste of time. Let's go.

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:49.290
Don't follow us. We don't have time
to play around with you.

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:52.990
Unfortunately, we're going in
the same direction.

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:56.410
You're spending the night
in the village up ahead, right?

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.700
I can show you around, if you want.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:00.370
That's helpful!

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:03.200
Oh, but I have to ask first...

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:07.790
You aren't from Orvelia by any chance, right?

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.830
We actually are...

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:13.660
Oops! Oh well, it is what it is.

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:16.490
Don't tell them you're from Orvelia.

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:21.290
If anyone asks, just say you're
from the Empire, like me.

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:23.950
Huh? You're from the Empire?

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:29.490
Yes. Anyway, just don't say
you're from Orvelia!

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:31.160
Why not?

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.160
I'll explain later.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:40.490
Here, this is the inn I'm using.

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:42.990
What? You're full?!

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:44.330
I'm sorry.

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:49.160
Then they can stay with me.
That's okay, right, manager?

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:53.950
Sure, any friend of Miss Reina
is welcome to stay with us.

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:56.080
Reina!

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.370
Leiden!

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:01.240
What do you want to do today?

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:04.160
No more playing! I'm going on an errand!

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:08.580
Oh no. Shut down.

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:12.870
He's just going shopping nearby.
He'll be back soon.

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:16.740
Leiden is my little lover.

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:20.660
And this is my big lover!

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:24.080
N-No, actually, we just met...

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:28.740
C-Come on, Kasel!
Just because you like Frey so much

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:31.450
doesn't mean you have to be so mean to me!

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:31.970
Huh?

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:35.490
Yikes, shut down yet again.

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:40.700
I'll make some tea. Please wait there.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:44.580
What a thick head!

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:46.080
Huh?

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:53.790
That's 15 people already! What's going on?!

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:56.200
Not even a clue left behind...

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.450
Are the Demons behind this?

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:01.870
If the Demons got them,
there should be bodies left behind.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:05.120
But they're all gone without a trace...

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:10.080
What's the most rational explanation?

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:13.910
Could the Orvelians be somehow involved?

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:15.990
It wouldn't be out of the question!

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:20.160
They're cold, cruel,
and don't see us as humans.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:23.950
Yeah! They even killed
defenseless women and children.

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:26.040
Some villages were entirely burned down!

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:32.200
We escape with nothing but our lives,
and yet they want to persecute us here, too?!

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:37.490
Come on, calm down. Some of those
who are missing are humans, too.

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:41.370
We don't know for sure that Orvelia is involved.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:43.540
Reina. Who are they?

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:47.740
My friends from the Empire.
They're helping me with my work.

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:51.410
I see. Let us know if you learn anything.

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:52.830
Yes.

00:08:56.040 --> 00:09:01.200
For the past month or so, people have been
disappearing from this village.

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:06.410
Dark Elves, humans, men, women,
young, old... Indiscriminately.

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:12.660
That negative reaction towards
Orvelia was pretty intense.

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:18.200
From the Dark Elves' point of view,
Orvelia is just a tyrant and slaughterer.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.790
But...!

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:24.990
For sure, until you leave this village,
don't talk about your home town.

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:26.580
But lying is...

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:29.410
Come on, lies are just a tool.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:32.120
It's useful for avoiding unnecessary conflicts!

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:35.040
Ugh, what a thick head!

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:38.160
This village and its problems don't concern us.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:40.580
Besides, we're leaving
early tomorrow morning anyway.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:43.990
What's the rush? Something going on?

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:51.040
I knew something was up. Oh well, I don't care.

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:51.610
Did you find him?!

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:54.450
No!

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:56.540
What's wrong?

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.790
Leiden is missing!

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:01.450
He was taking too long,
so I went to pick him up,

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.950
but the shop told me he left a long time ago...!

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:06.240
I can't believe even Leiden was taken, too!

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:09.830
We don't know that yet! Let's find him!

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.330
I'll help!

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:13.040
We should go, too!

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:33.240
Oh, Leiden...

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:38.620
We've thoroughly searched
the area around the village.

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:40.830
Let's expand the search.

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:44.830
Leiden, where did you go...?

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:46.990
I'll get more people.

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:48.490
I will go, too!

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:52.790
We should keep looking!

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:53.910
Yes!

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:55.620
Thank you. In that case, we can--

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:57.790
We should stay out of this.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:01.290
We don't want to get caught up
in something and delay our departure.

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:05.370
We should rest and get ready for tomorrow.

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:08.290
That's... not wrong.

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:11.990
How can I stand by while all this is going on?!

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:14.620
We're not leaving until tomorrow morning.

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:17.370
We just have to find Leiden before that.

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:19.120
Then it's not a problem, right?

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:25.700
If this is part of the larger missing
persons incident, what can we do?

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:30.240
This entire town has been searching for
a month, and they don't even have a clue.

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:32.200
That's especially why!

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:37.950
Fine.

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:42.200
Reina, any leads?

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:45.040
If I had any, I wouldn't be so stuck.

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:49.950
I was going to investigate the nearby
forest more thoroughly, but...

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:52.450
In that case, let's split up
and search the forest.

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:53.990
--Yes!
--Got it!

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:21.870
Miss Reina, you were searching
for the missing people, right?

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:25.990
Yes. I was hoping to find
at least some clues...

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:29.700
What's wrong?

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:33.290
There's no point in
wandering around aimlessly.

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:35.740
I have to be missing something...

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:47.120
I heard something.

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:48.790
Where did that come from...?

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:57.250
What kind of sound?

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.790
Shh.

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:00.950
Watch out!

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:09.620
A-Are you all right?

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:12.540
I don't think we can climb this.

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:15.160
Sorry, it's my fault...

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:20.490
No. I didn't even imagine
such a big hole would be here.

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:24.990
Maybe the sound I heard was the sound
of the wind passing through here.

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:27.330
Maybe there's a path deeper inside...

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:30.910
We should stay put until our eyes
get used to the darkness.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.580
I understand.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.450
Ugh, I'm so powerless...

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:37.540
Your friends will find you soon.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:41.120
They can't continue the journey
without you, right?

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:45.160
They all seem to value your opinion.

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:49.330
Yes. I can't do this trip without their help.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:53.870
I see. You're coming from Ogria Mountain.

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:56.870
Does that mean you're going
to Galluah Plain or something?

00:13:56.870 --> 00:14:00.370
Nobody has lived there for a hundred years.

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:04.620
No, we're going to the Windland Snow Mountain
to meet someone named Pavel.

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:09.870
What, the Snow Mountain?
That sounds like a big deal...

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:13.290
What important business
do you have with this Pavel person?

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:15.910
Are they a friend? Or...

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:21.330
We're trying to unseal the Holy Sword.

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:25.160
The Holy Sword? Uh...

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:28.080
You mean the one that belonged to King Kyle?

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:28.680
Yes.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:30.700
Why you?!

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:35.620
I... I'm the heir to the Holy Sword.

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:36.830
Heir?

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.290
Yes.

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:42.910
Hmm. I don't know if I really get it,
but in a nutshell, you're a big deal?

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:47.490
You seem low-key and thickheaded,
but have a secret power?

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:49.040
That's...

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:51.540
Details, or else...

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:55.160
I'll either kiss you or strangle you.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:57.080
What?! Miss Reina, please!

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:57.620
Oops.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.990
No joking around!

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:03.660
I'm... seriously worried about my power.

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:05.200
Power?

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:08.660
Right now, I'm dangerous!

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:10.160
A dangerous man?

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:13.370
Nice, I welcome that!

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:16.200
It's literal!

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:17.700
What do you mean?

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:23.700
I completely lost myself during a fight.

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:29.330
The Holy Sword's power swallowed me
up.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:34.120
Rather than protect everyone,
I might end up hurting them...

00:15:40.490 --> 00:15:44.990
Hmm, I can't find anything from here.

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:48.620
I guess I need to get down on the ground?

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:02.660
Huh? What is this?!

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:18.990
If it's so tough, you should just run.

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.240
Huh?!

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:24.700
Forget about the Holy Sword,
and live peacefully in Orvelia.

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:29.290
I know. You should marry Frey,
and live an ordinary life!

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:32.120
What?! But... That's...

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:33.540
Do you dislike Frey?

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:36.410
Of course not! She's a precious friend!

00:16:36.410 --> 00:16:37.700
Then why not?

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:40.160
That's not the point...

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:44.620
You need to live for yourself.
Otherwise, your heart will die.

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:47.620
Heart... Die...?

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:50.990
I might not look like one,
but I'm a noble's daughter.

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:55.580
The expectation was that one day,
I'll marry another noble for political gain.

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:58.160
That was the expectation, no alternative.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:01.660
It was suffocating, and I suffered every day.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:05.910
But one day, I realized.
There's more than one future.

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:08.330
I get to decide...

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:12.700
And now, I live free and I'm happy every day!

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:18.580
Kasel, you should break free from
your duties and responsibilities and stuff.

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:20.870
Not convinced, huh?

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:24.740
I just want to protect everyone!

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:28.290
You don't have to be
so clenched up all the time.

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:30.700
Are you that big of a deal?

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:31.990
Huh?

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:36.330
You lack presence and have no sense of humor.

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:40.490
Right now, you're waiting
for someone to help you.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:48.040
Is that...?

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:53.910
This is Leiden's.

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:56.540
Did he fall through here?

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:59.950
He fell, or was dropped.

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:01.910
Let's go deeper.

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:03.490
Yes.

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:29.370
What the...

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:30.870
Look!

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:38.450
Are the missing people in there?

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:39.620
Let's get them down!

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:41.160
Yes!

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:48.700
A spider Demon?

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:53.160
Cleo!

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.120
Kasel!

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:26.080
Kasel, keep it up!
I'll get its attention and--

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:42.080
Kasel?!

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.660
Kasel! Are you okay?!

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:54.540
I'm sorry, I...

00:19:56.410 --> 00:20:01.490
What?! What's this?!
It better not be trying to eat me!

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:06.200
Cleo! The sword!

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:07.580
Wait up!

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:18.540
Miss Reina!

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:20.910
Kasel! Run!

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:26.910
I won't run... Never!

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:51.120
They all came back!

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:53.330
--I'm glad.
--I'm so glad!

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:54.740
--You had us so worried.
--I'm so glad!

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:58.450
--I'm so glad you're back!
--Reina and the man helped me!

00:20:58.450 --> 00:21:01.330
Oh, we can't thank them enough...

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:04.830
I'm so glad everyone was fine.

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:09.290
Yeah. They were all just rendered
unconscious by the Demon's miasma.

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:12.540
They would all have been eaten
if you didn't get to them in time.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:17.330
That was so close.
I'm sure I'm super delicious!

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:20.870
Miss Reina, thank you for everything.

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:26.740
I guess your way of living is a good way, too.

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:31.580
I told you, you're allowed to run.

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:35.490
Are you sure you want to keep going?

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:37.240
Yes, I am.

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:40.330
I see. Such a thick head!

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:44.040
I'm not turned off by a bit of a thick head.

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:45.990
Huh? Oh, please, not again...

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:46.530
Huh?

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:48.160
"Again"?

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:49.450
Huh?

00:21:54.490 --> 00:21:56.540
See ya!

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:04.370
<i>This one wish</i>

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:07.120
<i>Connects you and me</i>

00:22:07.120 --> 00:22:09.910
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:22:09.910 --> 00:22:13.950
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:30.490
<i>A comfortable breeze passes over</i>

00:22:30.490 --> 00:22:36.370
<i>A memory in a precious place</i>

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:40.990
<i>From the day I decided to walk with you</i>

00:22:40.990 --> 00:22:47.700
<i>The promise that I hid in my heart</i>

00:22:47.700 --> 00:22:53.160
<i>I want to feel that moment, just once</i>

00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:55.450
<i>If I stretch my arm out</i>

00:22:55.450 --> 00:22:58.830
<i>I should be able to reach</i>
<i>the tomorrow in my dream</i>

00:22:58.830 --> 00:23:01.490
<i>This one wish</i>

00:23:01.490 --> 00:23:04.370
<i>I gently engrave in my heart</i>

00:23:04.370 --> 00:23:07.120
<i>The chain that connects the heart</i>

00:23:07.120 --> 00:23:09.910
<i>Cannot ever be broken</i>

00:23:09.910 --> 00:23:12.700
<i>The future which we should head to</i>

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:15.450
<i>Beckons us to come closer</i>

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:18.290
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:23:18.290 --> 00:23:21.240
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:23:46.910 --> 00:23:51.160
The knights of Orvelia escaped
to the village where Elise is.

00:23:51.160 --> 00:23:56.370
Riheet regains consciousness and learns
about what happened to the Black Edge.

00:23:56.370 --> 00:24:00.870
Driven by shock, he takes action...

00:23:58.580 --> 00:24:00.910
<i></i>Scars

00:23:58.580 --> 00:24:00.910
<i></i>of Loss
